  "releaseNotes": "Siticone UI Controls - Key Improvements:\n\nIMPORTANT - PLEASE READ BEFORE UPDATING:\n• Securely back up your existing projects before updating.\n• Read the changelog below carefully before updating your library version.\n• Contact Siticone support before updating if you have questions or need clarification.\n• Test the new version in a separate test project before applying it to a production project.\n\nBACKWARD COMPATIBILITY:\n• All updated controls remain backward compatible with existing projects.\n• Existing public properties, methods, events, themes, and common usage patterns have been preserved.\n• Always test the updated package in a separate project before deploying it to an existing production application.\n\nGENERAL IMPROVEMENTS:\n• Updated the UI layering to render correctly on 4K+ high DPI screens.",
